Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.72,0:29:42.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,70)}Sekian, terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.18,0:29:44.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(90,70)}{\fnMontserrat ExtraBold\c&H0AD6FF&}BETULKAN{\r} {\fnMontserrat ExtraBold\c&H0AD6FF&}AYAT,{\r} {\fnMontserrat ExtraBold\c&H0AD6FF&}SELAMATKAN{\r} {\fnMontserrat ExtraBold\c&H0AD6FF&}BAHASA!{\r}
